      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我发现门还开着，于是望了过去，\n发现秋川理事长正从外面探头进来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "424be3cad6e930ed88640b4dd1b7c30348905c07914a6c6eb118c7ad7c6780d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
